<title>USA: Iatros Health acquires 2 nursing homes.</title>
<headline>Iatros Health acquires 2 nursing homes.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iatros Health Network Inc said on Thursday that it has acquired two nursing homes in Massachusetts, which could add $7.6 million in annual revenues.</p>
<p>Iatros, which reported 1996 revenues of about $22 million, said the two facilities have a combined total of 171 beds. The facilities are located in Taunton and Quincy, he said.</p>
<p>Iatros said its acquisitions in 1997 have added nearly $18.0 million in annual revenues to the 1996 figure.</p>
</text>
